                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 409,
                            "playtime_at_review": 27148,
                            "last_played": 1793794319
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Wow just wow. Played for over 150 hours on switch when i was younger, then beat the game again on pc like 5 years ago, beat calamity as well, now 5 years later I'm beating it again with my friends. Talk about a game with unlimited potential. First of all the base game is insane. The enemies, the bosses, the items, THE GRIND! The amount of hours you can put in and still not get sick of it is ridiculous. One of the best games to play with friends. The mods are some of the best for any game. The amount of dedication that went into making them deserves a medal. Some double, some even triple the time it takes to beat, adds 1000s of items, and just makes it so much better than it already is. This is one of, if not THE best game i have ever played.\n\n10/10 must play game",
